notes.body:
The separator should remain consistent throughout this to avoid matching `xx-xx-xx:xx-xx-xx` for example. What about:
```
guchar sep = cp[2];
if ((sep != ':' && sep != '-') || cp[5] != sep) {
```

then the cases below should also check `sep` instead of `':'`.

